<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 28.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- Angolan Prime Minister Franca Van Dunem left for London at the weekend for a visit of 15 days, including medical tests.</p>
<p>- A 180 km (112 miles) stretch of railway between Luanda and Dondo, southeast of the capital, has been reopened after seven years.</p>
<p>--Luanda newsroom +2442 360-849</p>
